<title>RUSSIA: Noyabrskneftegaz 1996 Russian pre-tax 150 bln rbls.</title>
<headline>Noyabrskneftegaz 1996 Russian pre-tax 150 bln rbls.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's AO Noyabrskneftegaz 1996 pre-tax profit fell to 149.9 billion roubles from 445.8 billion roubles in 1995, to Russian cash-based account standards, the company said on Friday.</p>
<p>Net sales (VAT, excise payments and other similar payments exclusive) rose to 9.52 trillion roubles from 7.19 trillion roubles in 1995, Noyabrskneftegaz, one of main production units of NK Sibneft, one of Russia's dozen vertically integrated oil groups, said in a statement.</p>
<p>Sibneft's spokesman told Reuters Noyabrskneftegaz's results to accruals-based accountancy would be ready by April 1.</p>
<p>Year ending December 31: (billions of roubles)</p>
<p>					1996		 1995</p>
<p>    Net sales		     9,520.88	   7,186.16</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  149.90	     445.77</p>
<p>    Accounts receivable	 1,219.70	     377.48</p>
<p>    Accounts payable	    4,058.11	   2,204.14</p>
<p>    Oil production (million T)	 18.61		20.35</p>
<p>    Oil sales (million T)		18.45		 n/a</p>
<p>    Oil exports (million T)	     4.34		 n/a</p>
<p>In 1996 Noyabrskneftegaz signed a contract with Miller &amp; Lents to audit the company's oil reserves.</p>
<p>--Aleksandras Budrys, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
